{"id":"53e87e7796695b9e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/593_意识逻辑_Awareness_Logic.md","title":"593 意识逻辑 Awareness Logic","display":"593_意识逻辑_Awareness_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}\\)</span> 为非空有限主体集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a,A_a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a,A_a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子公式直接由命题变元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}\\)</span> 充当，不另设带标签的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}\\)</span> 构造子。显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_aA\">\\(K_aA\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_aA\">\\(A_aA\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_aA\">\\(A_aA\\)</span> 读作主体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 意识到公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(K_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(A_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{593}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{593}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(K_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(K_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{593}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{593}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{593})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{593}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{593})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{593}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{593}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,593}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,593}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{593}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{593})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{593}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{593}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{593})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{593}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{593}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{593}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{593}\\)</span>，替换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(K_aA,\\sigma)=K_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A_aA,\\sigma)=A_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(K_aA,\\sigma)=K_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A_aA,\\sigma)=A_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{593}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{593}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{593}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{593}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{593}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{593}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{593}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{593}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{593}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_a\">\\(K_a\\)</span> 的分配公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{593}=\\{K_a(A\\to B)\\to(K_aA\\to K_aB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{593}=\\{K_a(A\\to B)\\to(K_aA\\to K_aB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>意识闭包公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ANeg,a}^{593}=\\{A_a\\neg B\\leftrightarrow A_aB:B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{ANeg,a}^{593}=\\{A_a\\neg B\\leftrightarrow A_aB:B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AImp,a}^{593}=\\{A_a(B\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(A_aB\\land A_aC):B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AImp,a}^{593}=\\{A_a(B\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(A_aB\\land A_aC):B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AK,a}^{593}=\\{K_aB\\to A_aB:B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AK,a}^{593}=\\{K_aB\\to A_aB:B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AA,a}^{593}=\\{A_aA_bB\\leftrightarrow A_aB:b\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593},B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AA,a}^{593}=\\{A_aA_bB\\leftrightarrow A_aB:b\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593},B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AKnow,a}^{593}=\\{A_aK_bB\\leftrightarrow A_aB:\nb\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593},B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AKnow,a}^{593}=\\{A_aK_bB\\leftrightarrow A_aB:\nb\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593},B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{593}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{593}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}}\\left(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ANeg,a}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AImp,a}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AK,a}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AA,a}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AKnow,a}^{593}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{593}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{593}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}}\\left(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ANeg,a}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AImp,a}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AK,a}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AA,a}^{593}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AKnow,a}^{593}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{593}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{593}=\\{((A),K_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{593}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{593}=\\{((A),K_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{K_aA}\\ (Nec_a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{K_aA}\\ (Nec_a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{593}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{593}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}}\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{593}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{593}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{593}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}}\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{593}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{593}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{593}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}\\)</span>；每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{593}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{593}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{593}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{593}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{593}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{593}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{593}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{593}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{593}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{593}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{593}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{593}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{593}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{593}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{593}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{593}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{593}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{593}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{593}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-意识闭包证书\">8. 意识闭包证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"593\">\\(593\\)</span>-意识证书集合用公理族标签直接定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CertTag}_{593}=\\{\\mathsf{ANeg},\\mathsf{AImp},\\mathsf{AK},\\mathsf{AA},\\mathsf{AKnow}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CertTag}_{593}=\\{\\mathsf{ANeg},\\mathsf{AImp},\\mathsf{AK},\\mathsf{AA},\\mathsf{AKnow}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{593}=\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}}{}&amp;\n\\bigl(\n\\{(a,\\mathsf{ANeg},F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{ANeg,a}^{593}\\}\n\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{AImp},F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{AImp,a}^{593}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{AK},F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{AK,a}^{593}\\}\n\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{AA},F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{AA,a}^{593}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{AKnow},F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{AKnow,a}^{593}\\}\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{593}=\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}}{}&amp;\n\\bigl(\n\\{(a,\\mathsf{ANeg},F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{ANeg,a}^{593}\\}\n\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{AImp},F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{AImp,a}^{593}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{AK},F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{AK,a}^{593}\\}\n\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{AA},F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{AA,a}^{593}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{AKnow},F):F\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{AKnow,a}^{593}\\}\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>标签与五个闭包族一一对应，并把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_aA_bB\">\\(A_aA_bB\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_aK_bB\">\\(A_aK_bB\\)</span> 两种闭包保持为不同标签。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目有两个不同的主体索引模态：知识 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_a\">\\(K_a\\)</span> 与意识 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_a\">\\(A_a\\)</span>。意识算子不带必然化规则，只通过闭包公理约束。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Aw}_{593}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{593},\\mathsf{Prop}_{593},\\mathsf{Frm}_{593},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{593},\\operatorname{BV}_{593},\\equiv_{\\alpha,593},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{593},\\operatorname{Sub}_{593},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{593},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{593},(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{593})_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{593}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{593},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{593},\\operatorname{last}_{593},\\vdash_{593},\\mathsf{Thm}_{593},\\mathsf{CertTag}_{593},\\mathsf{Cert}_{593}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathc